<title>FINLAND: Rautaruukki sees improving 1997 earnings.</title>
<headline>Rautaruukki sees improving 1997 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish steel group Rautaruukki Oy said on Thursday it expected improving earnings and rising net sales in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Rautaruukki's earnings are estimated to be better than in 1996 provided that the trend in the steel market develops as forecast,&quot; the company said in a statement with its 1996 results.</p>
<p>&quot;The prices of steel products are estimated to strengthen during 1997,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>&quot;Group turnover for 1997 is estimated to be 13.5 billion markka,&quot; Rautaruukki said.</p>
</text>
